────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
2. STUDY CONTENT — not licensed for redistribution
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Applies to: the prose, tables and worked illustrations in index.html and
pages/*.html.

These are study notes. They paraphrase and summarise the sources cited inline
on each page — principally IRD's Departmental Interpretation & Practice Notes,
the Inland Revenue Ordinance (Cap. 112), the Stamp Duty Ordinance (Cap. 117),
and a professional taxation qualification manual. Because they are derived from
those sources, they are not the author's to place under an open licence.

You may read them and link to them. They are NOT licensed for republication,
redistribution, or inclusion in another work, whether commercial or not.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
3. CITED MATERIAL — belongs to its publishers
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

IRD's DIPNs, SOIPNs and EDOIPNs, the ordinances, the BIR return forms, and the
textbook from which some illustrations are derived remain the property of their
respective owners.

This repository does not redistribute any of them. The DIPN Index links to
IRD's own PDFs on ird.gov.hk, and legislation references point to
e-Legislation. Those copies are authoritative; the ones described here are not.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
4. NO WARRANTY, NO ADVICE
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Nothing in this repository is tax, legal, accounting or professional advice,
and no adviser-client relationship arises from reading it. The content is
